Scope
-----
This statement covers the source code, tests, configuration and documentation
in this repository. It does not cover the third-party dataset used by the code:

  GalaxyPPG v1.0.0, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.14635823, licensed CC BY 4.0 by its
  authors (Park, Zheng and Lee, KAIST). That dataset is not redistributed here;
  see data/README.md for how to obtain it and what its licence requires.

Third-party dependencies (NumPy, pandas, SciPy, scikit-learn, pytest) remain
under their own licences and are not affected by this file.
